<view class="community"><view class="title">注销账号</view><view class="notice">15天冷静期内可以撤销。期间可查看已有资料，暂停新增业务；再次使用前可先撤销。期满后账号停用，头像、联系方式和实名字段去标识化。交易、聊天、票据、证据和审计记录不随账号级联删除。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="load">{{error}} · 重试</view><view wx:if="{{info}}" class="card"><view class="title">前置检查</view><view wx:for="{{info.blockers}}" wx:key="label" class="muted">{{item.label}}：{{item.count}}</view><view wx:if="{{!info.blockers.length}}">目前没有未完成事务阻挡注销。</view><view wx:if="{{info.request.status==='PENDING'}}"><view class="muted">预计执行时间：{{info.request.executeAfter}}</view><view wx:if="{{info.request.lastError}}" class="error">执行暂缓：{{info.request.lastError}}。可撤销后处理。</view><button data-cancel="{{true}}" bindtap="act" loading="{{busy}}">撤销注销申请</button></view><button wx:else class="danger" disabled="{{busy||info.blockers.length>0}}" bindtap="act">申请注销</button></view></view>
